NOTE
The author, 2026-10-28: "whatever you find confusing or out of date correct it and record it because if you cant understand and you helped me build this then that leaves little hope for the public. the only way i know were done when no more questions can be asked without having an answer or proof to point to." One cue per question; the identifier is the cue that asked it. ANSWERED points to the cue or record that answers it; OPEN says what it waits on (work); CITE marks a question the author has answered whose source is still to be cited (the author, 2026-10-28: "all the questions are answered, they just need to be cited and sourced"). A cue that asked is not edited; this file says what answered it. The work is done when no cue here says OPEN.

